# No production push without asking

Never publish [ligasfutbolamateur.com](https://ligasfutbolamateur.com) unless the user explicitly says to in **this** turn.

That includes `git push origin main` on `marianoalfonso1707/lfaweb`, overlaying `dist` onto `main`, and any Cloudflare Pages production deploy.

Build locally or push `preview` / `matchday` when asked. Then ask before production.

“Remove X”, “change Y”, or a deploy from an earlier message is not permission to ship live.
